5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We need to fix the fee structure. I’m worried we’re guessing again. What data should we check first?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to understand why some members hesitate to commit. What records show their attendance patterns?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see who actually shows up versus who just pays. Let’s check the sign-in sheets and the rota.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Before we pick a structure, I need to know the true cost of collecting it. Who has the treasurer’s logged hours?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about how new members feel. Let’s look at the taster forms and the mid-year joiner records.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Jonathan, that hesitation is real. But @Takumi, checking the sign-in sheets will show us exactly who is carrying the load.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I agree. But @Toshio, if the collection process is too heavy, it might discourage people from joining in the first place.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, fair point. But if the work is uneven, the fee structure won’t fix it. We need the facts first.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the facts are the hours. If chasing money takes six hours a month, no structure is sustainable. I need that log.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I hear you. But @Mio, if we only look at the ledger, we might miss why people are hesitant to join in the first place.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
